## UPS area-surcharge ZIP list

`app/data/ups_area_surcharge_zips.csv` is a snapshot of UPS's
published Delivery Area Surcharge (DAS) and DAS Extended ZIP code
list, used by the carrier-optimization engine to detect rural
addresses and prefer USPS for affected destinations. The source data
is published by UPS for general carrier reference; consult UPS's
published tariffs for the authoritative current list.
